group{chiltern}{
We are a long established, friendly group, drawing our membership from the counties of Buckinghamshire, Hertfordshire, Oxfordshire and Bedfordshire. We do not have a committee or officers, but Bob Carter is the person to contact if you would like further information.

We now have 5 outdoor tracks across the area offering a range of running experiences. A number of our members are experienced in outdoor track construction, and the building of locomotives and rolling stock, so plenty of advice and help is available to the newcomer to Gauge 1.

An annual programme of running dates is produced, usually beginning in April, and to which all members are invited. In the winter we hold afternoon meetings at member’s homes.

Contact: Bob Carter – Email: bob@sasrikal.myzen.co.uk or 01296 706587
}
